        "message_id": "message_38d90a4f3060902572f1335c",
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "created_timestamp": 1792353847669,
        "former_node_id": "node-ret-owner",
        "former_node_name": "Retainer: Ownership",
        "message_id": "message_5b09b304b39d5b67d320b6d4",
        "new_node_id": "node-global-faq",
        "new_node_name": "GLOBAL - FAQ Handler",
        "role": "node_transition",
        "transition_type": "global"
      },
      {
        "content": "Nothing out of pocket — under California Lemon Law, the manufacturer pays our attorney’s fees and costs, so you never pay us or get a bill from us. If we don’t win or settle, you still owe us nothing. Does that answer your question?",
        "created_timestamp": 1792353849429,
        "message_id": "message_c3a106dc34179a7d3138cf05",
        "metadata": {
          "response_id": 9
        },
        "role": "agent"
      },
      {
        "content": "How long does the whole thing take?",
        "created_timestamp": 1792353850043,
        "message_id": "message_d72f4ae6003c9142b7bb65b3",
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "content": "Each case is different, but lemon law cases often average around eighteen to twenty-four months. The timeline can vary depending on how far the manufacturer is willing to go. Does that help?",
        "created_timestamp": 1792353851531,
        "message_id": "message_13a1f20c88f861a5ffb66cfe",
        "metadata": {
          "response_id": 10
        },
        "role": "agent"
      },
